# CSS-FONTS-4#font-relative

**Interaction With Font-Relative Units** (heading)

**SHA**: hash:681a7e3e4dea675f49236bfc7a757a869cf9b55335c8e94fd0b2314359cbf16f

## Content

The following properties defined in this specification are [font-affecting properties](CSS-VALUES-4#font-affecting-property):

*   All longhands (including [reset-only sub-properties](CSS-CASCADE-5#reset-only-sub-property)) of the [font](CSS-FONTS-4#propdef-font) shorthand, except [font-variant-emoji](CSS-FONTS-4#propdef-font-variant-emoji) and [line-height](CSS2#propdef-line-height)

*   All longhands of the [font-synthesis](CSS-FONTS-4#propdef-font-synthesis) shorthand

> **Note:** Note: Some properties that can affect the size of text are not [font-affecting properties](CSS-VALUES-4#font-affecting-property), because they do so via font shaping, which the [font-relative lengths](CSS-VALUES-4#font-relative-length) explicitly do not take into account.

